स्। Br. II. ३२. ९९.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apa": [{"id": "Apa", "headword": "आप", "headword_slp1": "Apa", "fold": "apa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "(I)--a व्यापक। एत्य्। of; came out of Agni, when the latter was lost in the earth. Br. I. 5. १३१-5; II. 6. ५६-7; २०. 1 and 5; वा. 6. 1.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(II)--a राक्षस with the शरत् sun. Br. II. २३. १५; वा. ५२. १५.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(III)--a son of वसिष्ठ, and a प्रजापति of the स्वारोचिष epoch. M. 9. 9.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "(IV)--is Bhava; hence do not commit nuisance in waters; nor bathe naked, nor have sexual intercourse in water; forsake colourless, tasteless and small waters; their source is the ocean and hence they must not be stopped in their progress to it. वा. २७. २१-7.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apakas": [{"id": "Apakas", "headword": "आपकस्", "headword_slp1": "Apakas", "fold": "apakas", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "--certain ग्रहस् which cause fear to children. वा. ६९. १९१.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apana (c)": [{"id": "Apana (c)", "headword": "आपन (च्)", "headword_slp1": "Apana (c)", "fold": "apana (c)", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "--a kingdom to which Puramjana went by the entrance मुख्या; allegorically व्यवहार। भा. IV. २५. ४९; २९. १२.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apanapa": [{"id": "ApanApa", "headword": "आपनाप", "headword_slp1": "ApanApa", "fold": "apanapa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "--a pupil of बाष्कलि. Br. II. ३५. 6.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apava (vasisWa)": [{"id": "Apava (vasizWa)", "headword": "आपव (वसिष्ठ)", "headword_slp1": "Apava (vasizWa)", "fold": "apava (vasisWa)", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "(I)--a sage of the time of second सावर्ण Manu.\n1: Br. IV. 1. ७०.\nFinding his hermit destroyed by कार्त- वीर्य's fire, cursed that he would be slain by परशुराम.\n2: Ib. III. ६९. ४४-5; M. ४४. 1. १२-14.\nResident of हेमतालवनम्.\n3: M. ४३. ४१.\n[page१-162+ २४]", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apava": [{"id": "Apava", "headword": "आपव", "headword_slp1": "Apava", "fold": "apava", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "(II)--the son of वरुण; cursed कार्तवीर्यार्जुन who allowed his तपोवन to be consumed by चित्रभानु; for ages past he was performing penance at the place, living on water. वा. ९४. ४३; ९५. ११-13.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apavatsa": [{"id": "Apavatsa", "headword": "आपवत्स", "headword_slp1": "Apavatsa", "fold": "apavatsa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "--to be worshipped in housebuildings. M. २५३. ३१; २६८. २०.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apastamba": [{"id": "Apastamba", "headword": "आपस्तम्ब", "headword_slp1": "Apastamba", "fold": "apastamba", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "--acted as priest in the पुत्रेष्टि of Diti. M. 7. ३३-4; १९२. ६०.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apastambi": [{"id": "Apastambi", "headword": "आपस्तम्बि", "headword_slp1": "Apastambi", "fold": "apastambi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "--a भार्गव, of आङ्गिरसप्रवर. M. १९५. ३३; १९६. १८.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apasTuRas": [{"id": "ApasTURas", "headword": "आपस्थूणस्", "headword_slp1": "ApasTURas", "fold": "apasTuRas", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "--एकार्षेयस्. M. २००. 4.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apadabadDa": [{"id": "ApAdabadDa", "headword": "आपादबद्ध", "headword_slp1": "ApAdabadDa", "fold": "apadabadDa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "purana-index", "senses": [{"gloss": "--the son of शातकर्णि, ruled for ३० years. वा. ९९. ३५१.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "apanagosWi": [{"id": "ApAnagozWi", "headword": "आपानगोष्ठि", "headword_slp1": "ApAnagozWi"